  "bodyHash": "476a0f6f7717e358",
  "content": "<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_20102128-4c3a-4bf7-9f3c-ea05c07d8b4b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"251\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>Это是一套药水的模组，它添加了原始效果和新的效果的药水。</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">药水列表</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>矮人药水</li>\n巨人药水<br/>\n<li>光辉药水</li>\n<li>迅捷药水</li>\n<li>漂浮药水</li>\n<li>低重力药水</li>\n<li>幸运药水制作</li>\n<li>挖掘疲劳药水</li>\n<li>强重力药水</li>\n<li>不幸药水</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_0d1d7d10-963a-413d-ac0c-70e05342bcfb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>侏儒效果会让你更小、更慢以及所有与之相关的事物。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_e84e4852-3787-465a-bcce-eba0daf0fa1c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"178\">这种药水的制作配方在下一张图片中。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_44ed040b-5e61-471b-8d97-58c904b41b0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"282\"></p>\n<hr>\n巨人效果会让你变大变快以及所有与之关联的特性。<br/><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_dec81c30-0de5-4dfb-85f1-4ba0697a67c4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"178\">该药水的配方如下图所示。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_1614cf34-9de4-4045-8670-da328b0ea318.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"185\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_f4816f80-56c3-412e-9a0c-22dce0dff84c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"401\" height=\"179\">这种药剂的制法在下面的图片中。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_9c2298c3-44e6-41b5-8fdf-27bc4bc5abd3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"255\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_a775f641-2f6b-48a6-859e-a99c7483f498.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"178\">这种药水的工艺如下所示。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_d4974f5e-c516-4c9d-87fd-8b077bb19990.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"129\"></p>\n<hr>\n低重力效果就像月球上的低重力一样，并且你会没有坠落伤害的限制。<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_bf422f9e-b150-4dc1-9862-6961e8dc339a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"401\" height=\"179\">这种药水的制配方如下图所示。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_ffc8465e-3e04-4f70-9412-8c76a78fe74d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"329\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_c948aa0e-a701-4446-ba87-82e8186f8d16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"401\" height=\"179\">此药水的炼制步骤见图。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_a4911aab-55d5-4d71-a254-cde2d7d25a2c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"103\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_2ef454f3-07d7-436a-8c36-fed02300c016.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"399\" height=\"184\">此药剂的制作方法是下图所示。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_b6e7d509-e77c-4419-957c-115e897c994b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<hr>\n强重力效果给你强大的重力，让你的下落伤害限制减少。<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_a7e1038e-6295-450a-957e-e32c74b1860c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"401\" height=\"185\"> 这种药水的配方见下张图。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_ce396b77-c08f-4bfd-80e5-5b7a9980d13e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"212\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1155125/description_9b14ebaf-1985-4e02-979e-f0b0e9a524f0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"401\" height=\"179\">该药的配方在下方图片中展示。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/f6KPHXSAHu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入Discord!</a></strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8caM3vCscz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1332588/description_be6a6f7e-407d-4109-8b98-57cc397ce0eb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"214\" height=\"214\"></a></p>",
